{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HISTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a <strong>gaucho</strong> in the South American fight for independence in 1822 and consume your enemies' fear to transform into the Zupay, a demonic legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gaucho tried to live a peaceful life after years of fighting in the <strong>independence war</strong>\u00a0along the northern border. When the enemy breaks into his life and leaves his village <i>besieged and devastated</i>, The Gaucho is possessed by a Native American myth, <strong>The Zupay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in the search for <strong>revenge</strong>, this creature pulls him back to <i>the violent life he thought was over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/fb3273660423d900442fd1b28e44c89f.poster.avif?t=1774633888\" width=512 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/fb3273660423d900442fd1b28e44c89f.webm?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/fb3273660423d900442fd1b28e44c89f.mp4?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTURE AWAITS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> royalists in your path for revenge! Prove your <strong>skills</strong> while facing different kinds of foes standing in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>stealth</strong> to take them down! Sometimes staying low is the best way to <strong>overcome</strong> the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/4ea5054d5f67391d1c87b9585a3748a6.poster.avif?t=1774633888\" width=512 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/4ea5054d5f67391d1c87b9585a3748a6.webm?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/4ea5054d5f67391d1c87b9585a3748a6.mp4?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather\u00a0<strong>resources</strong> that will help you in your journey! Look for money and special herbs to <strong>boost\u00a0yourself</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Find smart ways to\u00a0frighten</strong> your enemies!<strong> Consume their fear </strong>to awake the devil inside you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the <strong>Zupay</strong>! Bring out chaos by transforming into an <strong>unstoppable beast</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/e039598a4a48e307a309e73dca41e81d.poster.avif?t=1774633888\" width=512 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/e039598a4a48e307a309e73dca41e81d.webm?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/extras/e039598a4a48e307a309e73dca41e81d.mp4?t=1774633888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore territories, face challenges and fight until your last breath <u>to defend your homeland.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you just seeking revenge? Or is there something bigger than you to fight for?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074370?t=1774633888","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4074370?t=1774633888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/983b1b50d74ddd768140bacc544048cba82e039b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774633888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074370/983b1b50d74ddd768140bacc544048cba82e039b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774633888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4512720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAKE HISTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a <strong>gaucho</strong> in the South American fight for independence in 1822 and consume your enemies' fear to transform into the Zupay, a demonic legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gaucho tried to live a peaceful life after years of fighting in the <strong>independence war</strong>\u00a0along the northern border. When the enemy breaks into his life and leaves his village <i>besieged and devastated</i>, The Gaucho is possessed by a Native American myth, <strong>The Zupay.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in the search for <strong>revenge</strong>, this creature pulls him back to <i>the violent life he thought was over.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im